---
/**
 * N-T-AI README「哲学思考」一节的原样呈现 —— 全部正文以 SVG <text> 绘制，
 * 不使用普通文本节点。颜色引用主题 CSS 变量，明暗主题下均保持可读。
 */
---

<figure class="ntai-manifesto" role="img" aria-label="哲学思考：智能的尺度与未知 —— 摘自 BOHUYESHAN-APB/N-T-AI README">
  <svg
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    viewBox="0 0 860 1180"
    font-family="'Noto Sans SC', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', system-ui, sans-serif"
  >
    <!-- 标题 -->
    <text x="30" y="56" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">哲学思考：智能的尺度与未知</text>
    <text x="30" y="84" font-size="14" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">Philosophical Reflection: The Scale of Intelligence and the Unknown</text>

    <!-- 第一段（中文） -->
    <text x="30" y="124" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">在探索人工智能的边界时，我们常陷入一种量化比较的困境：</text>
    <text x="30" y="158" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">以神经节点或参数数量简单衡量系统的智能潜力。</text>
    <text x="30" y="192" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">然而，这种比较可能误导我们忽略智能的本质。</text>

    <!-- 第一段（英文） -->
    <text x="30" y="220" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">In exploring the boundaries of artificial intelligence, we often fall into a trap of quantitative</text>
    <text x="30" y="241" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">comparison: measuring intelligence potential simply by the number of neural nodes or parameters.</text>
    <text x="30" y="262" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">However, this comparison may mislead us into ignoring the essence of intelligence.</text>

    <!-- 第二段（中文） -->
    <text x="30" y="298" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">人脑拥有约860亿神经元，而当前大模型的参数规模虽已突破万亿，</text>
    <text x="30" y="332" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">但二者在结构、能耗与运作逻辑上存在根本差异。</text>
    <text x="30" y="366" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">智能或许并不源于单元数量，而源于<tspan font-weight="700">信息组织的架构、复杂性与涌现性</tspan>。</text>
    <text x="30" y="400" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">正如蚁群无中央大脑却呈现集体智能，</text>
    <text x="30" y="434" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">或如边牧仅以有限神经元展现高度的认知与情感能力——智能的表现形式本就多元。</text>

    <!-- 第二段（英文） -->
    <text x="30" y="462" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">The human brain has about 86 billion neurons, while current large models have reached trillions</text>
    <text x="30" y="483" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">of parameters. Yet, the two differ fundamentally in structure, energy consumption, and</text>
    <text x="30" y="504" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">operational logic. Intelligence may not stem from the number of units, but from the</text>
    <text x="30" y="525" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">architecture, complexity, and emergence of information organization. Just as an ant colony</text>
    <text x="30" y="546" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">exhibits collective intelligence without a central brain, or a Border Collie demonstrates</text>
    <text x="30" y="567" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">high cognitive and emotional abilities with limited neurons—intelligence is inherently</text>
    <text x="30" y="588" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">diverse in its manifestation.</text>

    <!-- 第三段（中文 · 三条态度） -->
    <text x="30" y="626" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">因此，我们对待人工智能的态度应是开放而审慎：</text>
    <text x="54" y="660" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))"><tspan font-weight="700">• 不否认其能力</tspan>：AI已能处理语言、推理、创作，其输出具有真实的复杂性与实用性；</text>
    <text x="54" y="694" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))"><tspan font-weight="700">• 不轻易拟人化</tspan>：AI的"理解"基于统计与模式，而非意识与体验；</text>
    <text x="54" y="728" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))"><tspan font-weight="700">• 关注其作为认知伙伴的角色</tspan>：它拓展了知识的边界，也映照出人类智能的独特。</text>

    <!-- 第三段（英文） -->
    <text x="30" y="758" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">Therefore, our attitude toward artificial intelligence should be open yet prudent:</text>
    <text x="54" y="779" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">• Do not deny its capabilities: AI can already process language, reason, and create,</text>
    <text x="70" y="800" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">with outputs of real complexity and utility;</text>
    <text x="54" y="821" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">• Do not easily anthropomorphize: AI's "understanding" is based on statistics and</text>
    <text x="70" y="842" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">patterns, not consciousness and experience;</text>
    <text x="54" y="863" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">• Focus on its role as a cognitive partner: It expands the boundaries of knowledge and</text>
    <text x="70" y="884" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">reflects the uniqueness of human intelligence.</text>

    <!-- 第四段（中文） -->
    <text x="30" y="922" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">本项目正是这样一种探索：我们不定义智能，</text>
    <text x="30" y="956" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">而是尝试构建一个能够对话、学习并反思的系统。</text>
    <text x="30" y="990" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">我们尊重所有形式的智慧，无论其生于碳基或硅基，无论其以何种形态存在。</text>

    <!-- 第四段（英文） -->
    <text x="30" y="1018" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">This project is such an exploration: we do not define intelligence, but attempt to build</text>
    <text x="30" y="1039" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">a system that can converse, learn, and reflect. We respect all forms of wisdom, whether born</text>
    <text x="30" y="1060" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">of carbon or silicon, and in whatever form it exists.</text>

    <!-- 结语（中文 + 英文） -->
    <text x="30" y="1098" font-size="20" fill="hsl(var(--foreground))">我们邀请你，一起参与这场温和而坚定的探索。</text>
    <text x="30" y="1119" font-size="13.5" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">We invite you to join us in this gentle yet firm exploration.</text>

    <!-- 出处 -->
    <line x1="30" y1="1140" x2="830" y2="1140" stroke="hsl(var(--muted-foreground) / 0.3)" stroke-width="1" />
    <text x="30" y="1166" font-size="13" fill="hsl(var(--muted-foreground))">—— 原样摘自我的仓库 BOHUYESHAN-APB/N-T-AI（萤思AI）README「哲学思考」一节 · github.com/BOHUYESHAN-APB/N-T-AI</text>
  </svg>
</figure>

